/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:19:- In the remaining teal/maroon track graph, there is exactly one simple
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:20:  4-connected path between the maroon endpoints.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:21:- Recolor teal pixels on that path to maroon; leave endpoints, blockers, and all other cells unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:22:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:23:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:24:- The orange pixels block nearby teal cells diagonally as well as orthogonally, which removes shorter decoy routes and makes the intended endpoint-to-endpoint path unique.
