/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:171:- Place the marker on the unique path-color pixel adjacent to the gate center but not between the two gate ends.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:172:- Components without both a marker and a gate stay unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:173:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:174:Key insight: The black-green-black motif marks the stopping gate; the gray marker consumes the connected green path until it rests on the path cell immediately beside that gate.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/6/prompt.md:175:</description>
